! jb_af1c F218 "STORE ROOT TEST", sub-block F218D "TESTS OF
! INDICATORS", p.168 (octal 021440.00-021444.40, the block's own exit
! "B,$+1.").  Continues fp_arith_f218c.strap and finishes F218 -- and
! with it the floating-point diagnostic.
!
! One sub-test, two questions, and between them they close the last gap
! F218A left open.  p.93/95 for SRT: "To-Memory Operation (MOP).  This
! indicator is set to ONE" -- SRT is the only floating-point operation
! that sets MOP rather than clearing it, apart from the other stores --
! and "Imaginary Root (IR).  This indicator is turned on when the
! accumulator sign, as modified by the absolute sign modifier, is
! negative."
!
! An LN load makes the accumulator negative, Z,$IND clears the
! indicator word, a plain SRT (no absolute modifier, so IR is not
! suppressed) runs, and both indicators must come on.  F218A12 set IR
! and then cleared it with a BIRZ without ever asking; this is where it
! is asked.
!
! The trailing Z,$IND leaves the indicator word clean for whatever
! follows, which matters because IR is permanent.
!
! TRANSCRIPTION NOTE: the source column reads "LN%N=,FPK72" but the
! printed code is 22114.10 60, and 022114 is FPK73, not FPK72 (022113).
! Transcribed from the PRINTED CODE, as F214C2's similar disagreement
! was.  It cannot change the test: both constants are positive before
! the LN inverts them, and nothing here checks the root's value.

! -- SSIP framework substitutes: SERS (octal 1304) -> FAIL halt,
! -- SEN (octal 1310) -> scratch.
        SLC, (8)1304.0
SERS    BEW, $
        SLC, (8)1310.0
SEN     DD(BU,64,8), 0

! -- constants (pool p.177) --
        SLC, (8)22114.0
FPK73   DD(BU,64,8), (8)0030000000000000000400
        SLC, (8)22355.0
ROS     DD(BU,64,8), 0

        SLC, (8)21440.0
! F218D - test MOP and IR indicators on
F218D   B, $+.32
        LN(N), FPK73                         ! accumulator sign made negative
        Z, $IND
        SRT(U), ROS
        SIC, SEN
        BZMOP, SERS                          ! error if MOP indicator off
        SIC, SEN
        BZIR, SERS                           ! error if IR off
        Z, $IND
PASS    BEW, $                               ! 021444.40: the block's exit "B,$+1."
        END, F218D
